#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid "A DFT adjustment cannot exceed its actual posted tax source."
msgstr "Úprava DFT nesmie presiahnuť skutočný zaúčtovaný daňový podklad."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A DFT adjustment needs its actual posted tax source and retained legal "
"allocation evidence."
msgstr ""
"Úprava DFT potrebuje skutočný zaúčtovaný daňový podklad a uchované právne "
"zdôvodnenie priradenia."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A DFT correction must have an acyclic chain within the same company and "
"month."
msgstr ""
"Opravy DFT musia tvoriť reťazec bez cyklov v rovnakej firme a mesiaci."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A bank batch needs an explicit amount and unique reference for every "
"individual payment."
msgstr ""
"Banková dávka vyžaduje výslovnú sumu a jedinečný odkaz každej jednotlivej "
"platby."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A bank transaction must reference the posted credit of a bank journal's "
"payment account."
msgstr ""
"Banková transakcia musí odkazovať na zaúčtovaný kredit platobného účtu "
"bankového denníka."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A filed DFT notice retains its company, period and correction identity after"
" reset."
msgstr ""
"Podané oznámenie DFT zachová firmu, obdobie a identitu opravy aj po resete."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A foreign-currency DFT source needs the official dated exchange quote; EUR "
"uses one."
msgstr ""
"Zdroj DFT v cudzej mene potrebuje oficiálny kurz platný k dátumu transakcie;"
" euro používa kurz jedna."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A non-IBAN refund needs the company's foreign account number and the bank's "
"SWIFT/BIC, name, city and country."
msgstr ""
"Vrátenie na účet bez IBAN vyžaduje číslo zahraničného účtu firmy a "
"SWIFT/BIC, názov, mesto a krajinu banky."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/wire.py:0
msgid "A refund request needs a negative total or additional difference"
msgstr "Žiadosť o vrátenie vyžaduje záporný súčet alebo dodatočný rozdiel"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A regular DFT notice has no original; a correction must reference a filed "
"notice."
msgstr ""
"Riadne oznámenie DFT nemá predchodcu; oprava musí odkazovať na podané "
"oznámenie."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A resident payer's bank transfer or cash withdrawal uses the whole actual "
"debit, not an arbitrary cost allocation."
msgstr ""
"Prevod alebo výber hotovosti rezidenta používa celý skutočný debit, nekráti "
"sa ľubovoľným podielom nákladov."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"A selected bank journal has a Slovak account, but only foreign-provider "
"payer grounds are selected. Verify whether the domestic bank already "
"collected this tax. Special-account grounds can legitimately concern a "
"domestic account; this warning does not change the calculated amount."
msgstr ""
"Vybraný bankový denník má slovenský účet, ale označený je iba dôvod "
"zahraničného poskytovateľa. Overte, či túto daň už nezrazila domáca banka. "
"Dôvod osobitného účtu sa môže oprávnene týkať domáceho účtu; toto "
"upozornenie nemení vypočítanú daň."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/wire.py:0
msgid "A tax amount must contain whole cents"
msgstr "Suma dane musí obsahovať celé centy"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.dft_form
msgid "Accounting and refund"
msgstr "Účtovanie a vratka"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__message_needaction
msgid "Action Needed"
msgstr "Vyžaduje akciu"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__activity_ids
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "Aktivity"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Activity Exception Decoration"
msgstr "Dekorácia výnimky aktivity"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__activity_state
msgid "Activity State"
msgstr "Stav aktivity"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__activity_type_icon
msgid "Activity Type Icon"
msgstr "Ikona typu aktivity"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax_source__actual_on
msgid "Actual On"
msgstr "Skutočný dátum"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.selection__l10n_sk_transaction_tax__filing_type__additional
msgid "Additional"
msgstr "Dodatočné"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax__adjustment_ids
msgid "Adjustment"
msgstr "Úprava"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"Allocate whole monetary units of the source currency; do not round the "
"converted EUR tax base."
msgstr ""
"Priraďte sumu v platných jednotkách pôvodnej meny; nezaokrúhľujte "
"prepočítaný eurový základ pred výpočtom dane."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax_source__source_amount
msgid ""
"Allocation in the native line currency. Empty uses the full transaction."
msgstr ""
"Priradená suma v mene účtovného riadku. Prázdna hodnota použije celú "
"transakciu."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.field_l10n_sk_transaction_tax_adjustment__amount
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Suma"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/wire.py:0
msgid "An additional notice needs its discovery date and previous known tax"
msgstr "Dodatočné oznámenie vyžaduje deň zistenia a poslednú známu daň"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"An earlier identified recharge source changed. Prepare an amendment of this "
"later notice; retain its original filed XML."
msgstr ""
"Zmenil sa skorší zdroj identifikovanej preúčtovanej transakcie. Pripravte "
"opravu tohto neskoršieho oznámenia a uchovajte jeho pôvodné podané XML."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_sk_transaction_tax.selection__l10n_sk_transaction_tax_source__kind__card
msgid "Annual used card"
msgstr "Ročné použitie karty"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/wire.py:0
msgid "Annual used-card tax belongs to December of its usage year"
msgstr "Ročná daň za použitú kartu patrí do decembra roku jej použitia"

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"Another process is allocating this company's DFT sources. Reload and retry."
msgstr ""
"Iný proces priraďuje zdroje DFT tejto firmy. Obnovte údaje a skúste znova."

#. module: l10n_sk_transaction_tax
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_transaction_tax/models/dft.py:0
msgid ""
"Another process is changing this DFT notice or its correction chain. Reload "
"and retry."
msgstr ""
"Iný proces mení toto oznámenie DFT alebo jeho opravy. Obnovte údaje a skúste"
" znova."

